### Priloženie telefónu k stolu 1 (uloží token hosťa)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/session
Content-Type: application/json

{"tableId": 1, "token": "dev-token-stol-1"}

> {% client.global.set("guestToken", response.body.token); %}

### Zlý token stola → 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/session
Content-Type: application/json

{"tableId": 1, "token": "zly-token"}

### Menu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Menu bez tokenu → 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/menu

### Objednávka: 2× halušky bez slaniny, pizza so šampiňónmi, kofola
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"menuItemId": 4, "quantity": 2, "removedIngredientIds": [9]}, {"menuItemId": 3, "quantity": 1, "addedIngredientIds": [14]}, {"menuItemId": 6, "quantity": 1}]}

### Chyba: odobratie cesta z pizze → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"menuItemId": 3, "quantity": 1, "removedIngredientIds": [11]}]}

### Privolanie čašníka
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/waiter-call
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Účet
GET http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Hosť na správu menu → 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}